WEBVTT


00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.800
Listen up, asshole.


00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.400
I'm taking you in right now.


00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:04.900
Have I ever arrested the wrong person?


00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.900
I'll leave the answer to the judge.


00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.100
My philosophy is ...


00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.900
The good guys catch the bad guys.


00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.500
Before the 1997 Hong Kong Handover


00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.300
4 fives! 4 fives!
- That doesn't count!


00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.200
Here, have some more!


00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:31.900
7 sixes!


00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.600
Do you know how to play?


00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.700
Waiter, give her the rule book!


00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.500
Let me introduce you to my younger brother, Tiger.


00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.100
-Hello, Brother Shan.
Hello.


00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.400
Your hands are wet.


00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.200
That's my big brother... Zha.


00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.400
I have a lot of stuff to move.  There are other smugglers who can do it.


00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.800
Why should I have you ...
- If you want to do Vietnam,


00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.500
It has to be us three.


00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.600
Who would know the place better than us?
We're Vietnamese!


00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.600
However you want to split it, we'll go along with it.


00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.100
That's all there is to it!


00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.500
That didn't count!  Again, again!


00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.500
4 ones, I win!
- 4 ones?


00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.600
That's not right!


00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.100
Well it's right because I said so!


00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.000
Police! We're checking ID!


00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.200
You.  Come here.


00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.500
I threw that bottle.


00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.100
So what?


00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.700
My apologies.


00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.600
I'm sorry! I'm so, so, sorry!


00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.300
January 2nd, 1997.


00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:00.400
Club Mongkok, while checking ID,
you assaulted a patron,


00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.000
and broke his pelvis in 3 places.
He spent 2 months in the hospital.


00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.600
How do you plead?


00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.700
February 17th, 1997.


00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.600
During a Triad investigation,
you assaulted another person,


00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.000
The criminal sustained serious head injuries.


00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.000
According to the doctor, he has permanently lost his sense of taste.


00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.000
How do you plead?


00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.800
March ...
- That’s enough.


00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:26.700
I'm guilty.


00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:30.300
In the first half of this year,
on average you have been involved in 14 cases each month.


00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.400
In each case, you've injured, on average, 3 people.


00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.700
Half a year!  You've already broken your record from last year!


00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.900
What's the problem with police apprehending criminals?


00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.600
That's what I do!


00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.500
Are you going to let us do our jobs, or what?


00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.500
Inspector Jun, I know that you are an outstanding officer.


00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.100
You have the highest number of solved cases on record.


00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.400
But I want to remind you ...


00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.700
You need to pay attention to your attitude and your methods.


00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.400
I don't see the problem.


00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.300
OK, you're free to leave.


00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.900
You know something?


00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.700
Since I came in, you've talked for an hour straight.


00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.400
Who knows?  In that hour, I could have solved a case!


00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.100
You need to reconsider your operating standards,


00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.400
and stop wasting everyone's time.


00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.400
Nice!


00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.000
That's 50 thousand!  You still want to bet?


00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.400
Don't bet against me, you'll lose everything!


00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.200
Tiger ... that's not how you play golf!


00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.700
It's not martial arts, forget your stances.


00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:42.800
Here, I'll teach you.


00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.500
It’s simple.  Hold the club like this.


00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.800
Make sure your thighs and shoulders are level.


00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.300
Look where you're aiming, then look at the ball.


00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.500
Then swing through hard!


00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.100
That was a bad demonstration.


00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.100
Next time, next time, eh?


00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.600
Boss. We've got a problem.


00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.000
Hold on.


00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.400
These guys don't know anything.


00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.400
Go ahead.


00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.900
I asked you to move the stuff to Vietnam.


00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.000
It’s been 2 months!


00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.500
Don't give me bullshit!  Where's my cargo?!


00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.500
Are you trying to fuck me over?!
- Look ...


00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.600
The ship's stuck in a storm!


00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.700
So stop blaming us!


00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.600
It'll be your problem if the ship sinks.


00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.600
That shipment is worth 80 million!
You've only covered 2 thousand!


00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.700
You should have told me earlier, I would have sent it by courier!


00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.200
It’s just a few days by plane.


00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.500
If you're shipping it by sea, of course it will take a few months!


00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.300
Go home and wait.


00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.800
What did you say?


00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.100
Don't be stupid now.


00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.800
Otherwise, I'll kill you.


00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:14.300
You don't scare me!  Who the hell are you?


00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:17.200
I come looking for Tony, and instead I find you morons!


00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.200
Get Tony over here!


00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.500
Motherfucker!


00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.300
This is how we work!


00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:06.400
Don't do that in public!


00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.400
Put on some suntan lotion!


00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.700
Come on, now!  Are you still pissed?


00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:19.300
Calm down! You two are always arguing!


00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:21.600
Inspector!


00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.300
Stop trying to be cool all the time!


00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.800
Why don't you just arrest people?


00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.900
You're always beating people up!  We know you can fight!


00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:32.300
Every time you come looking for me, you want me to save you!


00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.800
And if something bad happens, you blame it on me!


00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.400
What are you whining about, muscle man?


00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:37.800
You're the one that hurt me!


00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.400
Last time you injured my arm, the doctor said that there would be complications!


00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.700
You threw wine in my face!


00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.700
If I didn't do something, everyone would be suspicious!


00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.200
You're the one that fought back!


00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.700
Of course I fought back!
I can't lose my street cred!


00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.400
Street cred? You're a cop!


00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.500
Yeah, why don't you say it louder, idiot!


00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.800
Look, you shouldn't have been so heavy handed.


00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:01.400
And you know he's a loose cannon, and you still lit a fire under him!


00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.400
When you got me into this shit, you made it sound good!


00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.400
Now my life's in danger!


00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.700
How long do I need to stay undercover?


00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.500
We're not talking about that.  Let's talk about the facts.


00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.500
Who is your superior here?


00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.500
Oh, not this shit again.


00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:17.200
What? You need to start following orders.


00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.300
Stop arguing!  The two of you will probably never work together again anyway.


00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.000
What?  Are you serious?


00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.900
The complaint report is out.


00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.100
You'll keep your position, but next month you're off the case.


00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.800
What?  There's no need for that!


00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:31.200
You said it yourself.  Both of you need to follow orders.


00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.300
That's bullshit.


00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.000
Keep going.  Watch your ass.


00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.400
Same to you.


00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.600
Do what you need to do.  But be careful.


00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:56.200
If I die, then I die!  I'm going in!


00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.400
You're playing it wrong again!


00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.000
Wrong over and over!


00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.500
Where was I wrong?


00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.900
After the 6th note, the E flat!


00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:46.000
I didn't hear anything wrong, except for you shouting!


00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.300
You guys need to take this seriously!


00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:51.000
You think we're just fucking around?  Then leave!


00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.100
Not everyone does things your way, Inspector Jun!


00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.500
You ..
- You must have been wrong.


00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.200
If an officer makes a mistake,


00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.800
they will ruin someone else’s life, as well as their own.


00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.500
Take it seriously, and improve your work.


00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.900
What are you doing here, mom?


00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.700
I knew you were here, and wanted to let you know ..


00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.600
I'm going back to the country.


00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.000
Wait until I'm done, I'll take you myself.


00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.200
I've already waited.


00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.900
Waited until Auntie Chang died.


00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:20.100
I'm going back to pay my respects.


00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:23.700
If I like it there, I'm staying there.


00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.900
Come on, mom.


00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.500
I'm lonely here by myself.


00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:32.800
You work all day, and have no time for me.


00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:37.400
Son, don't abandon your life for your job.


00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.400
What should be important to you is your life.


00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.300
Without your life, how can you be someone?


00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.600
Take care.  I'm leaving now.


00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.500
So let me get this straight.


00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.400
You stole Shan's shipment.


00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.100
He wanted to negotiate, and you turned it to a fight.


00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:28.800
And now you ask us to ignore it.  Why?


00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.000
Look, we'll take care of Shan ourselves.


00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.500
It would be bad if they found out you're involved.


00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.200
Just ignore the whole thing, and nothing will happen.


00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.600
We don't want to be involved in this shit.


00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.900
You need to remember where you came from.


00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.800
If we didn't take you in, you'd still be floating in the sea.


00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:54.100
Our family was stuck in a refugee camp.


00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.000
It wasn't much different than living in prison.


00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.100
Why did we fight?


00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.800
Because we wanted a place of our own.


00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.100
If people ever got in our way,


00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.700
then we went to war.


00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:18.500
Brother.


00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.700
So, how'd it go?


00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.100
Did it go bad?


00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.200
No, nothing yet.


00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.900
The talks haven't even started yet.


00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:29.700
Don't do anything for now, otherwise there'd be nothing to discuss.


00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.000
Don't be unreasonable now.


00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.300
That's it.  I'm gonna do it.


00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.400
Wait, wait ...


00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:40.900
How about you talk to them?


00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:46.200
Four eyes, your wife takes your kid to school pretty early.


00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:47.500
What if something bad happened to them?


00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.300
Are you threatening me?


00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.600
Of course I'm threatening you, motherfucker!


00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.900
I don't want to hurt anyone’s feelings.


00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:59.200
If we can work this out,
there will be many more opportunities for us in the future.


00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.400
Hey, see that sexy woman in red ...


00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.900
walking with her four-eyed kid?


00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:13.200
When I tell you to, I want you to run them over!


00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.000
OK.


00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:18.100
So, have you thought it over?


00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.700
Your family is about to reach the entrance.


00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:27.700
I'm not getting an answer!


00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.800
We'll ignore the situation with Shan.


00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.800
Speak up.  I don't think he heard you.


00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.400
We'll ignore the situation with Shan!


00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:48.100
Don't do anything stupid!


00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.600
Zha, it's Da Xia.


00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:55.900
Let's go out for drinks! We're all friends here!


00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:58.500
You should have said that from the start!


00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.400
Have some breakfast.


00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:11.000
I bought it for you guys.  Don't be unreasonable now.


00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.100
Run them over.


00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.000
OK.


00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:23.600
Turn!


00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.100
Are you a dog?  So obedient!


00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.600
Just because I told you to, you'd do it?


00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.500
You could have killed them!


00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:42.300
Hey, I'll treat you out for your birthday tonight.


00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.100
I'm going to meet with some friends.


00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.400
What? You have friends?


00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.500
Yeah.
-Alright.


00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:54.100
Here, have fun.


00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.300
Thank you, Boss.


00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.600
Lily?


00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.400
It's me.  Are you free?  Come over!


00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.400
What'd you say?


00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.000
What are you yelling at me for?


00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.600
May!  Let me talk to your daughter!


00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.600
What?  She's dead?!


00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:40.800
- I'm so sorry ...
- Bobby?  It's Wilson.


00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.400
What's up?  It's my birthday today!


00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.500
Come on, let's not talk about that shit!


00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.000
I just wanted to know if you wanna hang out or something...


00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.700
Hello? Hello? ... Hello?


00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.400
Hi, is Julie there?


00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.600
Happy birthday.


00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.900
Thank you.


00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.900
Are you done with work?


00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.800
Not yet.  I'll come over afterwards.


00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.700
OK, bye bye.


00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.400
Bye bye.


00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.500
It’s been a while.


00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:53.500
It hasn't been that long.  We met half a year ago.


00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.100
Have you been to Vietnam recently?


00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.300
If you're going, you should be careful.


00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.400
You might get caught.


00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.200
Even if I'm just going there for a bowl of noodles?


00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.200
I thought you were gonna quit your job at the bar?


00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.800
I do want to quit,


00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.700
but what else can I do?


00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:14.000
Unless ...


00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.100
You want me to be a prostitute?


00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:23.800
Don't do that.  Do something respectable.


00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.200
You're a pretty girl, you know.


00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:30.100
Why don't you go into modeling?


00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.000
You really think so?


00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.400
Well, of course!


00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.800
I think with your good looks,


00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.900
you'd be able to land a good gig somewhere!


00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.600
And what about you?


00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.500
No way, I'm not photogenic at all!


00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:53.000
The only ads I'd be able to do would be for Johnnie Walker!


00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:58.100
I'm gonna take a shower.  Join me.


00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.400
Tiger, are you really going to do this?


00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.400
This isn't like you.


00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:02.800
So where you want to go later?


00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.400
I want to go on a picnic!
-OK.


00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:11.000
Get out of here!


00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.200
- Cops!  Get in!
You're lucky!


00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:16.500
You can leave hospital at anytime.


00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:18.400
If you keep fighting, I won't let it go so easily!


00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.600
If you want to die, don't get me involved!


00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:23.200
I want to testify.


00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.400
Come in.


00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.600
Inspector Wong, we've bought in the criminal.


00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:53.000
That hurt, Inspector Wong.


00:22:53.900 --> 00:22:56.200
Do you have something to drink?  It’s hot.


00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.700
Shan's spilled the beans about Tony!


00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:01.700
That’s great!  Let's go arrest him then!


00:23:01.700 --> 00:23:03.600
We're assembling the task force right now.


00:23:03.800 --> 00:23:06.200
You need to be careful, or you'd be first to die!


00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:08.800
I know, I'm more scared than you are!


00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.100
Inspector, please don't tell me you're leading the team on this one.


00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:15.100
Relax, I'm not the one
that's been keeping tabs on those Vietnamese kids.


00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:17.000
Get them to bring back Jun!


00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:18.800
This is a time when the department needs him the most!


00:23:18.900 --> 00:23:20.300
It's you who needs him the most, right?


00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:21.300
Yeah.


00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.300
Inspector.


00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:29.900
Shut the door!


00:23:30.100 --> 00:23:31.200
What are you doing?


00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:33.100
Do you want me to get caught?


00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:36.900
OK, what am I being brought in for?


00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:39.300
Come on, why else would we call you back?


00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:41.700
Help us solve this case,
so we can all take a vacation, OK?


00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:42.900
Yes, sir!


00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.500
Here, put this on your head.


00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:47.400
Put it on!


00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:49.500
Let me finish my smoke!
- No, put it out!


00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:51.500
Your breath smells enough like shit already!


00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:55.500
Put it on, fucker!
This is for your own good!


00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.700
Inspector Wong, he's not co-operating!


00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.300
Take him out for a beating, then.


00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:02.700
Hong Kong's about to be handed over,
can't you guys take things a little more seriously?


00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.300
It’s their mother's big birthday tonight.


00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:07.400
Those three will definitely be there.


00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.700
We'll take care of their associates first.


00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:18.700
Sir, we're going to have to take you to the station.


00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:22.500
OK.


00:24:22.800 --> 00:24:24.900
Brother Wilson.
- Hello.


00:24:25.100 --> 00:24:26.600
Brother Wilson.
- Hello, hello.


00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:29.000
Eat, have some!


00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:31.600
Doesn't it smell good? Try it!
- Auntie!


00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:35.400
I wish you riches, health, happiness,


00:24:35.400 --> 00:24:38.300
and that you stay beautiful forever!


00:24:38.300 --> 00:24:40.200
Oh, thank you ...
- Thank you, thank you, thank you!


00:24:40.200 --> 00:24:42.000
How's your appetite?


00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:45.000
Stop talking to her, she’s not eating!


00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.500
Leave now!


00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:48.200
Auntie, enjoy your meal!


00:24:49.300 --> 00:24:51.500
If they're not returning calls, then keep calling!


00:24:52.400 --> 00:24:53.900
What time is it?!
No one's here!


00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:57.300
- Please calm down, sir.
- Don't tell me to calm down!


00:24:59.600 --> 00:25:01.500
Here, have a bite.


00:25:04.200 --> 00:25:05.400
Tiger!


00:25:05.700 --> 00:25:06.900
Come here!


00:25:09.200 --> 00:25:11.300
You're so loud that mothers' not eating any more!


00:25:11.300 --> 00:25:12.700
Kneel!


00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:15.800
Apologize to mother!


00:25:16.500 --> 00:25:19.600
Mother, please eat some!


00:25:26.600 --> 00:25:28.600
So, everyone's here.


00:25:28.600 --> 00:25:33.700
If no one goes to see Zha,
who will be there to celebrate their mother's birthday?


00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:36.800
Have a mouthful.


00:25:36.800 --> 00:25:38.800
Eat, ma!


00:25:40.100 --> 00:25:42.700
If you don't want this, then what do you want?


00:25:52.700 --> 00:25:54.300
You don't like it?


00:25:54.300 --> 00:25:57.200
We'll order something else, OK?  Sea cucumber?


00:25:58.100 --> 00:26:00.400
Abalone?  You don't like it?


00:26:00.400 --> 00:26:02.700
Then I'll order Bird's Nest Soup for you!


00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:04.700
Shark Fin?


00:26:04.800 --> 00:26:07.300
Big Brother, something's wrong.


00:26:07.300 --> 00:26:10.500
What's more important than mother not eating?


00:26:13.500 --> 00:26:14.300
Eat, ma!


00:26:14.300 --> 00:26:16.500
Tiger, feed mother.


00:26:16.800 --> 00:26:19.300
Time to work ...


00:26:19.700 --> 00:26:22.000
Stay here tonight.


00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:23.700
Someone will take care of you.


00:26:24.800 --> 00:26:27.200
You must catch them, Inspector Jun.


00:26:32.400 --> 00:26:33.500
Here.


00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:38.900
Have a mouthful.


00:26:40.600 --> 00:26:42.900
The food here doesn't suit you.


00:26:42.900 --> 00:26:44.300
I'll take you somewhere else, OK?


00:26:44.300 --> 00:26:45.700
- Tiger.
- Where?


00:26:45.700 --> 00:26:46.900
Don't worry, let's go!


00:26:46.900 --> 00:26:49.000
Wilson! Come here!


00:26:49.000 --> 00:26:50.300
Coming.


00:26:50.500 --> 00:26:52.000
Hurry up!


00:26:52.800 --> 00:26:54.800
Hey, manager!


00:27:00.200 --> 00:27:01.400
Did you drive today?


00:27:01.400 --> 00:27:04.300
Where is your car parked?


00:27:14.500 --> 00:27:15.400
Hello?


00:27:15.400 --> 00:27:17.300
Tony, go and get the money.


00:27:17.300 --> 00:27:19.200
I'll leave with mother first.  We'll meet at the docks.


00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:20.700
Understood.


00:27:22.500 --> 00:27:23.900
Where to, Tony?


00:27:23.900 --> 00:27:25.100
To the garage.


00:27:25.700 --> 00:27:28.000
Brother, what’s happening?


00:27:36.400 --> 00:27:38.500
Have you seen these people?  What time was this?


00:27:39.400 --> 00:27:40.500
- Inspector Jun.
- What's the situation?


00:27:40.500 --> 00:27:42.200
Someone's injured, an ambulance is on the way.


00:27:46.200 --> 00:27:47.300
Xiao Ying.
-Yes.


00:27:47.600 --> 00:27:48.800
Check his vehicle registration.


00:27:48.800 --> 00:27:50.200
Xiao Ya, get this cleaned up.
-Yes, sir.


00:27:54.500 --> 00:27:55.400
Hello?


00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:58.600
Where are you? I'm outside your front door.


00:27:58.600 --> 00:28:01.100
I’m busy.  I'll call you back later.


00:28:03.200 --> 00:28:05.500
I can wait here until you come back.


00:28:05.500 --> 00:28:07.300
Not tonight.


00:28:07.300 --> 00:28:08.700
I made a spare key for you.


00:28:08.700 --> 00:28:11.200
I'll give it to you next time.


00:28:12.300 --> 00:28:14.300
Hey! Can you not talk on the phone!


00:28:14.300 --> 00:28:15.600
Sorry.


00:28:28.900 --> 00:28:32.000
Da Pao, the target vehicle is a dark green Mazda MPV.


00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:34.300
License, JL2933


00:28:34.300 --> 00:28:36.000
Also, a burgundy Acura Legend.


00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:38.100
License, DE3654.


00:29:18.900 --> 00:29:21.200
Hey, give us a hand!


00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:53.300
Brother Tiger, did you lock the door?


00:29:53.400 --> 00:29:54.300
Aw, shit.


00:29:54.300 --> 00:29:57.200
I'll check it, take this.


00:30:09.800 --> 00:30:12.300
They're leaving with the money, call you later.


00:30:30.900 --> 00:30:32.200
We can go now, Brother Tony.


00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:34.500
- Is it locked?
- Of course.


00:30:44.100 --> 00:30:45.800
Sit in the back.


00:30:47.200 --> 00:30:48.600
No problem.


00:31:05.900 --> 00:31:08.100
That's the car!


00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:19.900
Wilson, give me your phone.


00:31:26.700 --> 00:31:28.200
Brother Tony.


00:31:47.900 --> 00:31:49.500
Mother, sit tight.


00:31:51.400 --> 00:31:53.100
Don't drive so fast!


00:32:21.000 --> 00:32:22.900
Pull over!  This is the police!


00:32:22.900 --> 00:32:24.300
I said, pull over!


00:32:26.500 --> 00:32:28.000
Mother, sit tight!


00:32:34.800 --> 00:32:36.500
Jia Hui, we're in pursuit!


00:32:36.800 --> 00:32:38.700
Are you alright?  Hang in there!


00:32:38.700 --> 00:32:41.500
I want to vomit.
- Vomit in here.


00:32:41.500 --> 00:32:43.400
You'll feel better after you throw up.


00:32:43.500 --> 00:32:45.500
It's alright.


00:32:52.000 --> 00:32:53.000
We're heading through the industrial district!


00:33:31.700 --> 00:33:33.900
Get out!


00:34:06.800 --> 00:34:08.300
His body will be at the docks.


00:34:58.700 --> 00:35:00.800
Hey, look over there!


00:35:07.300 --> 00:35:09.100
Hey, man.  Are you alright?


00:35:13.900 --> 00:35:15.300
- How's Wilson?
- Inspector Wong.


00:35:15.300 --> 00:35:17.300
Don't know yet, they're still working on him.


00:35:17.500 --> 00:35:19.800
They'll fix him up.  Stay calm.


00:35:23.300 --> 00:35:24.300
Hey, what are you doing?


00:35:24.300 --> 00:35:26.000
You bastard cops!


00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:26.600
What are you doing?


00:35:26.600 --> 00:35:28.100
What's it to you?!


00:35:28.400 --> 00:35:29.500
Are you Julie?


00:35:29.500 --> 00:35:30.900
I can arrest you for assaulting an officer!


00:35:30.900 --> 00:35:32.300
So what if you're a cop?


00:35:32.300 --> 00:35:34.300
Wilson is my partner!


00:35:39.100 --> 00:35:41.200
He's undercover.


00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:22.300
What are you in for?  Triad activity?


00:36:22.500 --> 00:36:23.700
I'm not a Triad member.


00:36:23.700 --> 00:36:26.100
No? Then join me!


00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:29.800
Call me Brother Zha.


00:36:30.300 --> 00:36:31.800
Do it!


00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:33.500
Brother... Zha.


00:36:35.100 --> 00:36:37.800
Have you ever seen your sons assaulting people?


00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:40.800
I have three sons?


00:36:42.500 --> 00:36:45.300
I've never seen them.


00:36:47.100 --> 00:36:52.400
Sir, can you call the police for me?


00:36:53.800 --> 00:36:57.000
Sir, call the police for me.


00:36:58.800 --> 00:37:02.700
My sons are missing.


00:37:06.800 --> 00:37:09.300
No one will come to see her on holidays.


00:37:09.300 --> 00:37:12.000
Perhaps, never at any other time either.


00:37:12.100 --> 00:37:15.600
Take care of her for me.  Her mind tends to wander.


00:37:22.900 --> 00:37:26.900
It's my birthday!  I'm 80!  You should have come earlier!


00:37:26.900 --> 00:37:30.000
I'm 80...


00:37:34.700 --> 00:37:37.700
Xian Wei Zha, there is sufficient evidence that shows,


00:37:37.700 --> 00:37:40.600
that during the period from 1992 to 1997,


00:37:40.600 --> 00:37:44.700
you were involved in multiple accounts of
assault, smuggling, and Triad activity.


00:37:44.700 --> 00:37:47.400
Those are the charges.  How do you plead?


00:37:47.900 --> 00:37:50.000
Not guilty.


00:37:50.600 --> 00:37:52.600
Hearing is set for May this year.


00:37:52.600 --> 00:37:55.000
I'm transferring the case to the North Kowloon courts.


00:37:55.800 --> 00:37:58.900
Use this time to gather your reasons.


00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:01.200
You are denied bail and permission to leave the country.


00:38:01.800 --> 00:38:04.100
All your assets are now frozen,


00:38:04.100 --> 00:38:05.600
until the sentence has passed.


00:38:06.200 --> 00:38:08.200
Wow!  You're putting all this on me?


00:38:08.200 --> 00:38:10.200
You think you can convict me?


00:38:10.600 --> 00:38:11.400
Let's go.


00:38:11.400 --> 00:38:14.000
Hey, take your hands off me!


00:38:14.300 --> 00:38:15.700
I'll sue you for sexual assault!


00:38:15.800 --> 00:38:16.700
Move it.


00:38:20.800 --> 00:38:22.700
3 months later


00:38:30.600 --> 00:38:32.300
I won't be able to keep up with you soon.


00:38:32.300 --> 00:38:34.400
Then I'll slow down to wait for you.


00:38:34.400 --> 00:38:37.200
Take it easy.  You'll get used to it.


00:38:37.500 --> 00:38:39.100
Oh, I don't know.


00:38:39.300 --> 00:38:42.500
I lost the use of a leg,
you think I'll get used to that?


00:38:44.000 --> 00:38:46.200
Everything's been sorted out for you.


00:38:46.200 --> 00:38:50.000
Next week, you'll be transferred to a desk job.


00:38:50.100 --> 00:38:51.600
Desk job?


00:38:51.600 --> 00:38:54.100
Why don't you get the government
to give me some compensation?


00:38:54.100 --> 00:38:57.700
Not only won't they pay,
but I have to cough up my own legal fees!


00:38:58.100 --> 00:39:01.800
Everything's sorted?
Are you kidding me?


00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:04.200
You know I've done everything for the force!


00:39:04.200 --> 00:39:06.300
What have I gotten out of it?


00:39:06.300 --> 00:39:11.100
Instead, I end up being a fucking gimp.


00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:15.900
The people at the station are waiting for
your return, so hang in there.


00:39:15.900 --> 00:39:18.100
I am hanging on!


00:39:18.600 --> 00:39:22.200
And how many people are waiting for me?
Just you?


00:39:23.100 --> 00:39:25.800
I forgot something,
don't wait for me.


00:39:30.900 --> 00:39:32.500
Careful ...


00:39:49.700 --> 00:39:54.400
Brother, Tiger and I will return before your trial.


00:39:55.000 --> 00:39:59.200
I won’t give Wilson or Shan the opportunity to testify.


00:40:13.900 --> 00:40:15.200
Tiger.


00:40:29.900 --> 00:40:31.300
Mother.


00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:37.500
My sons.


00:40:38.500 --> 00:40:40.700
I'll take you home.


00:40:43.500 --> 00:40:46.900
Mother, do you remember this place?


00:40:46.900 --> 00:40:48.900
We used to live here.


00:40:48.900 --> 00:40:52.200
After I pickup Big Brother,
we can leave Hong Kong.


00:41:41.500 --> 00:41:42.900
Here.


00:41:43.400 --> 00:41:44.100
What are you smiling about?


00:41:44.100 --> 00:41:47.300
Nothing.  Maybe injuring your leg was a good thing.


00:41:47.300 --> 00:41:48.700
That way you can't run around every day.


00:41:48.700 --> 00:41:50.800
And you can stay home and keep me company.


00:41:51.400 --> 00:41:52.900
You've taken care of me for so long.


00:41:52.900 --> 00:41:55.000
You must like me a lot.


00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:56.700
Don't you know that in every woman


00:41:56.700 --> 00:41:59.600
is a natural sense to care for others?


00:42:00.300 --> 00:42:03.300
On behalf of your inherited ability,


00:42:03.300 --> 00:42:05.300
I hope that it will be like this forever.


00:42:06.200 --> 00:42:07.200
Thank you.


00:42:07.200 --> 00:42:09.200
You're welcome.


00:42:22.800 --> 00:42:24.200
They're here!


00:42:25.400 --> 00:42:26.500
Let me get changed!


00:42:26.500 --> 00:42:28.500
- Careful!
-  Come on, come on.


00:42:30.800 --> 00:42:31.600
- Hello.
- Hello!


00:42:31.600 --> 00:42:33.000
Delivery!


00:42:34.800 --> 00:42:36.600
Be careful.


00:42:37.600 --> 00:42:39.700
Come and have a look!  It's good stuff.


00:42:44.900 --> 00:42:45.700
Is it that good?


00:42:45.700 --> 00:42:46.900
It's heavier than him!


00:42:46.900 --> 00:42:49.500
Why do you live on the roof?
I'm so tired!


00:42:49.500 --> 00:42:51.000
We only helped carry it.


00:42:51.000 --> 00:42:53.200
Jun, he bought it and delivered it.


00:42:53.200 --> 00:42:54.900
Where do you want it?


00:42:56.000 --> 00:42:57.200
Over there.


00:42:57.400 --> 00:42:58.600
OK.


00:42:58.600 --> 00:43:01.300
Move over!


00:43:01.400 --> 00:43:03.600
Put some muscle into it!


00:43:04.400 --> 00:43:06.600
Careful, don't scratch it!


00:43:07.900 --> 00:43:10.300
That cost over 30 thousand.  He paid for it himself.


00:43:10.300 --> 00:43:12.700
That's sincerity.  Accept it.


00:43:12.900 --> 00:43:14.700
Do you have a power strip?
- Yeah.


00:43:14.900 --> 00:43:18.100
Here, let me do that.  You guys are so useless.


00:43:18.600 --> 00:43:20.000
Where's the power strip?


00:43:24.400 --> 00:43:26.800
I know you're no good with English,
so it's in Chinese.


00:43:26.800 --> 00:43:29.600
Like driving, it's automatic.


00:43:29.600 --> 00:43:31.500
Try using this button.


00:43:32.700 --> 00:43:34.400
You always said that your leg hurt.


00:43:34.400 --> 00:43:36.900
This will help improve the circulation to your leg.


00:43:36.900 --> 00:43:40.900
The blood moves freely to the leg,
but the leg itself can't.


00:43:43.300 --> 00:43:45.500
It should be easy for you.


00:43:45.500 --> 00:43:48.600
Train your right leg to be as flexible as your
left leg, and you'll be fine.


00:43:53.100 --> 00:43:54.500
What did you say?


00:43:54.500 --> 00:43:57.000
I'm kidding!


00:44:01.600 --> 00:44:04.400
So it wasn't that funny.
Forget it.


00:44:09.500 --> 00:44:10.900
I'll get it.


00:44:13.900 --> 00:44:15.200
Take out.


00:44:17.600 --> 00:44:19.000
That smells good!


00:44:20.400 --> 00:44:21.500
What is it?


00:44:21.500 --> 00:44:22.700
Something good.


00:44:37.800 --> 00:44:41.000
You know, there's a lot of pressure being a cop.


00:44:41.000 --> 00:44:43.000
Then why don't you think about
doing something else?


00:44:43.800 --> 00:44:47.300
Whatever you do, I'll join you.


00:44:47.600 --> 00:44:49.500
Come over and eat.


00:44:55.300 --> 00:44:57.000
Wow, all this looks good!  Let's eat!


00:44:57.900 --> 00:44:59.900
Wait, let's take a picture first!


00:44:59.900 --> 00:45:00.900
OK, take a picture as we eat!


00:45:00.900 --> 00:45:02.300
No, the picture first!


00:45:02.300 --> 00:45:04.000
This is my only request.


00:45:04.000 --> 00:45:04.700
Like this.


00:45:04.700 --> 00:45:05.700
A picture with the chicken?


00:45:05.700 --> 00:45:07.900
Whatever, just go with it!


00:45:08.200 --> 00:45:09.400
Come!


00:45:23.200 --> 00:45:25.100
The chicken's a bit cold.


00:45:25.300 --> 00:45:26.400
Wait!


00:45:26.800 --> 00:45:27.800
Let's heat it up!


00:45:27.800 --> 00:45:29.500
If we don't improve our standards,
how can we become better people?


00:45:29.500 --> 00:45:31.800
It doesn't matter, we can still eat it!


00:45:33.000 --> 00:45:35.700
It’s so easy to heat it up!


00:45:43.800 --> 00:45:46.300
Chicken, 200 degrees.


00:45:47.900 --> 00:45:50.200
I'll go help Inspector Wong.


00:47:24.400 --> 00:47:26.400
Is Julie alright?


00:47:29.200 --> 00:47:31.400
She's under observation.


00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:39.000
Are you alright?


00:47:45.200 --> 00:47:47.100
I'm filling in for Inspector Wong.


00:47:50.300 --> 00:47:53.200
For security reasons, you are all placed on leave.


00:47:55.800 --> 00:47:59.500
They killed the Inspector.  And witnesses.


00:47:59.900 --> 00:48:03.100
And you want us to take a break?


00:48:03.100 --> 00:48:05.100
I'm worried for your safety.


00:48:05.500 --> 00:48:07.000
We're all risking our lives!


00:48:07.000 --> 00:48:09.000
You take charge, and you put us on leave?


00:48:10.700 --> 00:48:13.700
You're confused and emotional right now,
please leave.


00:48:15.700 --> 00:48:19.600
When I was undercover,
I was living under the cover of fear every day.


00:48:20.000 --> 00:48:22.400
They fuck up my leg,


00:48:22.400 --> 00:48:23.800
then they blow up my home!


00:48:23.800 --> 00:48:24.800
Now you want me to leave?


00:48:24.800 --> 00:48:28.600
Obviously, you don't deserve to wear that uniform!


00:48:28.600 --> 00:48:31.100
If there is sufficient evidence,
I will arrest the people involved.


00:48:31.100 --> 00:48:32.400
Do you have any evidence?


00:48:40.800 --> 00:48:43.100
Report to Madam for
what else needs to be done.


00:49:54.200 --> 00:49:57.100
Tony.  Where's Tony?


00:50:01.800 --> 00:50:03.900
Enough!  You're gonna kill him!


00:50:06.700 --> 00:50:08.700
Give me your gun.
Give me your gun!


00:50:08.700 --> 00:50:10.000
Give me your gun!


00:50:10.800 --> 00:50:12.000
Give me your gun!


00:50:17.100 --> 00:50:17.900
Give me your gun!


00:50:17.900 --> 00:50:21.900
Come on, man!  He doesn't know shit!


00:51:52.600 --> 00:51:55.700
Madam, what do we do now?


00:51:58.100 --> 00:52:01.000
The most important thing
is to find out what happened to Tony.


00:52:01.400 --> 00:52:04.300
The most important thing
is to protect Wilson in the hospital.


00:52:04.700 --> 00:52:06.200
He's our only witness left.


00:52:08.200 --> 00:52:09.300
Xiao Ying, let's go.


00:52:09.300 --> 00:52:11.400
Let's go.
Why are you still writing?


00:52:14.200 --> 00:52:17.200
My mother has a place in the country.


00:52:17.500 --> 00:52:20.100
Song Flower River.


00:52:26.500 --> 00:52:28.200
The country?


00:52:32.500 --> 00:52:34.500
Let's leave together.


00:52:36.400 --> 00:52:38.300
We'll start a family.


00:52:44.200 --> 00:52:45.500
Are you sick of this place?


00:52:49.700 --> 00:52:52.200
Though, after living in Hong Kong for so long,


00:52:52.200 --> 00:52:55.200
I've never felt that this place was home.


00:52:59.800 --> 00:53:01.800
My mother wants us to visit her.


00:53:03.500 --> 00:53:06.300
All three of us.


00:53:11.800 --> 00:53:14.100
I'm two months pregnant.


00:53:22.700 --> 00:53:24.000
Are you worried?


00:53:40.300 --> 00:53:42.000
Everyone entering the hospital must be searched.


00:53:42.000 --> 00:53:45.300
All the exits, doors, stairs, toilets,


00:53:45.300 --> 00:53:47.000
must be under watch.  Understood?


00:53:47.000 --> 00:53:48.000
Yes, sir!


00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:50.400
Nothing happens to Wilson before he testifies.


00:53:50.700 --> 00:53:54.200
Hey, the baby's hungry.


00:53:54.300 --> 00:53:56.600
Should we give it something to eat?


00:53:57.400 --> 00:53:59.900
I'll go buy you something.


00:54:04.800 --> 00:54:06.900
Don't go anywhere.


00:54:57.300 --> 00:54:59.100
Inspector Jun, wait.


00:54:59.100 --> 00:55:01.400
Wilson, Inspector Jun told you not to go anywhere.


00:55:01.400 --> 00:55:03.000
Thanks.


00:55:16.200 --> 00:55:18.900
Police!  Move!  Move!


00:55:30.200 --> 00:55:31.700
Shots fired inside the elevator!


00:55:31.700 --> 00:55:33.300
Get backup!  Quickly!


00:57:12.500 --> 00:57:13.300
Hello?


00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:14.200
I have her.


00:57:14.600 --> 00:57:17.700
OK, OK, OK!  What do you want?!


00:57:19.000 --> 00:57:20.600
Are you scared?


00:57:20.600 --> 00:57:22.000
Yes, yes!


00:57:22.100 --> 00:57:25.400
Whatever you want, just say it!  I'll do anything!


00:57:36.100 --> 00:57:38.200
Watch out!  Stupid ass!


00:58:08.800 --> 00:58:10.300
Move!


00:58:17.400 --> 00:58:19.000
Mommy!


00:58:21.600 --> 00:58:23.400
Drop the gun!


00:58:24.000 --> 00:58:26.100
Put the child down!


00:58:26.200 --> 00:58:28.100
I said drop the gun!


00:58:30.100 --> 00:58:31.700
Are you deaf?


00:58:31.800 --> 00:58:33.500
Put the child down!


00:58:33.500 --> 00:58:35.900
Do you want her to die?!


01:01:31.900 --> 01:01:34.100
Inspector Jun, what's the situation?


01:01:35.200 --> 01:01:36.900
Inspector Jun!


01:02:13.200 --> 01:02:14.700
It’s time to go to court.


01:02:54.800 --> 01:02:56.200
Hello?


01:02:56.200 --> 01:02:58.100
Wilson, where are you?


01:02:58.100 --> 01:02:59.500
I'm heading off to court.


01:02:59.500 --> 01:03:01.600
Did something happen to Julie?


01:03:03.900 --> 01:03:05.100
Yeah.


01:03:06.200 --> 01:03:09.700
Don't believe them!  They'll never let her go!


01:03:11.700 --> 01:03:13.600
I have no choice.


01:03:14.100 --> 01:03:15.700
How can you not have a choice?


01:03:15.700 --> 01:03:18.600
You're helping those bastards!


01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:20.900
I don't want anything to happen to her.


01:03:20.900 --> 01:03:23.000
I don't want anything to happen to both of you!


01:03:23.100 --> 01:03:24.700
Do you want to die with her?


01:03:26.800 --> 01:03:27.500
Hello?!


01:04:01.100 --> 01:04:03.300
You need to record a statement.


01:04:04.700 --> 01:04:07.100
You beat the criminal to death!


01:04:07.100 --> 01:04:08.900
Then arrest me.


01:04:17.400 --> 01:04:20.000
Witness.  You may now testify.


01:04:47.500 --> 01:04:49.300
I don't remember anything.


01:04:56.600 --> 01:04:58.400
Due to sustained injuries,


01:04:58.100 --> 01:05:01.700
the witness is unable to testify due to amnesia.


01:05:01.700 --> 01:05:04.600
All charges against the accused ...


01:05:04.600 --> 01:05:08.300
are dropped due to lack of evidence.


01:05:41.800 --> 01:05:43.300
Tony.


01:05:43.800 --> 01:05:46.100
I'm out.


01:06:06.500 --> 01:06:09.700
Speak!  Where are you?!


01:06:10.300 --> 01:06:11.300
South Shengwei.


01:06:12.200 --> 01:06:15.900
Come quickly.  I'll be waiting.


01:06:17.400 --> 01:06:19.800
Stop it!  Don't hit him!


01:06:21.100 --> 01:06:22.900
Stop hitting him!


01:06:22.900 --> 01:06:24.900
Wilson!


01:06:25.300 --> 01:06:27.300
Wilson!


01:06:28.900 --> 01:06:32.000
I knew I wasn't going to leave.


01:06:31.900 --> 01:06:34.900
I just want you to let her go.


01:06:35.500 --> 01:06:38.500
Wilson!


01:09:03.500 --> 01:09:05.700
Shoot! Shoot him, Tony!


01:09:07.800 --> 01:09:10.000
Come on! You scared?


01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:11.300
Drop the gun!


01:09:11.300 --> 01:09:13.900
- Drop the gun!
- On your mom's dead body!


01:09:13.900 --> 01:09:15.100
- Fucker!
- Shoot him now!


01:09:15.100 --> 01:09:16.400
Don't talk about my mother!


01:09:39.400 --> 01:09:40.000
Brother!


01:10:10.800 --> 01:10:12.000
I'm going to kill you bastard!


01:10:16.100 --> 01:10:16.800
Fuck!


01:12:08.900 --> 01:12:10.700
I'll drive.


01:12:24.300 --> 01:12:25.800
Open the door!


01:12:25.800 --> 01:12:28.000
What are you thinking?  Open the door!


01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:29.700
What are you doing?


01:12:30.100 --> 01:12:33.400
Leave with me!  Don't go back!


01:12:33.600 --> 01:12:36.700
Leave with me!  You promised you wouldn't go!


01:12:55.300 --> 01:12:57.100
Ma Jun, come out and fight!


01:13:17.700 --> 01:13:19.100
Fuck you!


01:13:21.600 --> 01:13:23.200
Ammo!


01:21:48.800 --> 01:21:49.800
Let's go!


01:25:02.000 --> 01:25:05.200
Have I ever arrested the wrong person?


01:25:05.200 --> 01:25:08.100
I'll leave the answer to the judge.


01:25:08.100 --> 01:25:11.600
My philosophy is ...


01:25:12.400 --> 01:25:13.700
The good guys catch the bad guys.

